WEBVTT

00:00:00.650 --> 00:00:04.148
Journey sixteen: manage products and services.

00:00:04.148 --> 00:00:09.318
An owner keeps what their business sells and offers on Jubilee up to

00:00:09.318 --> 00:00:09.698
date.

00:00:10.566 --> 00:00:15.001
Products lists each item with its price, status and requests.

00:00:15.001 --> 00:00:19.800
Each row now has a handle to drag it, with the arrows kept for the

00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:20.454
keyboard.

00:00:21.158 --> 00:00:25.755
Add product now takes a photo. It is uploaded, checked and scanned

00:00:25.755 --> 00:00:29.726
before the product is saved, and shows beside the button.

00:00:30.631 --> 00:00:35.581
The editor also has the minimum order and the options, such as sizes,

00:00:35.581 --> 00:00:37.303
each with its own stock.

00:00:42.388 --> 00:00:47.016
Saving lists the product with its photo, and the toast links to it in

00:00:47.016 --> 00:00:47.620
the shop.

00:00:48.931 --> 00:00:53.742
Dragging a product by its handle moves it, saves the new order and says

00:00:53.742 --> 00:00:54.691
where it went.

00:00:55.944 --> 00:01:00.747
On the product page, members see the photo in place of the tile, named

00:01:00.747 --> 00:01:01.776
by the product.

00:01:02.919 --> 00:01:07.319
A product the shop deletes after a member saved it reads No longer

00:01:07.319 --> 00:01:08.919
available in their list.

00:01:09.960 --> 00:01:14.680
Behind the screen, the tests prove an infected photo is refused, uploads

00:01:14.680 --> 00:01:19.204
are limited to thirty an hour, and a draft listing's catalogue can be

00:01:19.204 --> 00:01:19.728
managed.

00:01:20.597 --> 00:01:26.534
Journey sixteen is complete. Jubilee takes no payment: members pay the

00:01:26.534 --> 00:01:28.061
business directly.
